IMPORT `tasco-ch3-accident`

-- Chapter IV, the owner's civil liability for goods carried: Articles 21 to 26.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/tasco-voluntary-motor.txt.
-- Article 24 repeats Article 14 almost word for word; its grounds are Article 14's
-- (`A reduction ground`, tasco-ch2-own-damage.l4), with one difference in 24.1.4 (below).
-- The order of the steps follows Chapter II (fork F-13): Article 25's amount, plus the costs of
-- 21.2, less the reduction, less the deductible, at most the limit.

§ `Chapter IV — The owner's liability for goods carried`

-- src:1049 | CHƯƠNG IV
-- src:1050 | BẢO HIẾM TRÁCH NHIỆM DÂN SỰ CỦA CHỦ XE
